    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.poster.avif?t=1737528199\" width=782 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.webm?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.mp4?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a free independent short narrative game. We hope to bring players a unique immersive experience through a concise and profound plot. Although the game time is not long, we have devoted our efforts to every detail. Thank you for taking the time to enter our world. We hope that your journey can arouse some touching and thinking in you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My father retired, and he, who had been living with his mother, finally had some free time. I thought it would be better to go find my children who were far away, and they just happened to move back to Beijing. The mother was unwilling to leave this rural town, but her daughter persuaded the mother to finally leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My father and mother visited their daughter's home in Beijing. They talked about my father's understanding of his own belonging and the memories he had with his wife in the past.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the family members in the past memories are separated by a long distance, they feel the warmth during the two phone calls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the two people who came to Beijing felt that distant village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.poster.avif?t=1737528199\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.webm?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.mp4?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story style of literature in the 1990s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the plot through dialogue and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn art style</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operation mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: moving character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter: confirm/select</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.poster.avif?t=1737528199\" width=782 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.webm?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/0cd553b622faca17c62cdeb869e531be.mp4?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a free independent short narrative game. We hope to bring players a unique immersive experience through a concise and profound plot. Although the game time is not long, we have devoted our efforts to every detail. Thank you for taking the time to enter our world. We hope that your journey can arouse some touching and thinking in you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My father retired, and he, who had been living with his mother, finally had some free time. I thought it would be better to go find my children who were far away, and they just happened to move back to Beijing. The mother was unwilling to leave this rural town, but her daughter persuaded the mother to finally leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;My father and mother visited their daughter's home in Beijing. They talked about my father's understanding of his own belonging and the memories he had with his wife in the past.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the family members in the past memories are separated by a long distance, they feel the warmth during the two phone calls apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the two people who came to Beijing felt that distant village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.poster.avif?t=1737528199\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.webm?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3294060/extras/f4d2bc8316389f044f421ed96e336764.mp4?t=1737528199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story style of literature in the 1990s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the plot through dialogue and exploration</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful hand-drawn art style</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Operation mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WASD: moving character</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter: confirm/select</p>",
